Narration: And so they talked about little things.
Narration: The weather, the birds, and the kingdom beyond the forest.
Narration: They talked about things Lily had never seen with her own eyes.
Narration: Time passed much faster than either of them realized.
Layla: I should go.
Layla: If I stay any longer, my mother will be angry
Layla: (And she'll be back soon)
